---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import LegalShell from "../components/LegalShell.astro";
import { REPOSITORY_URL } from "../lib/site";
---
<BaseLayout title="Licenses" path="/licenses/"><LegalShell title="Licenses and attribution" description="Source availability and third-party acknowledgements.">
  <h2>SendArc source</h2><p>SendArc incorporates and modifies <a href="https://github.com/marcfargas/go-mapi">go-mapi</a> by Marc Fargas. Covered source is published under LGPL-3.0-or-later at <a href={REPOSITORY_URL}>{REPOSITORY_URL}</a>.</p>
  <h2>Third-party software</h2><p>Dependency licenses and notices are preserved in <a href={`${REPOSITORY_URL}/blob/main/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`}>THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md</a> and relevant vendored directories. Google, Gmail, Windows, and Affixa names belong to their respective owners.</p>
  <h2>Independence</h2><p>SendArc is independent and is not affiliated with Google, Microsoft, Affixa, Notably Good Ltd., or the original go-mapi author.</p>
</LegalShell></BaseLayout>
